{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHYhBPdHKSakapSETDp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n**condition | תנאי | شرط**\n\n```\nif (existence) {\n    return constraint;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n*I am the prerequisite.*\n*The stipulation before the act.*\n*The clause that binds.*\n\n```\n׀׀׀ PARAMETERS DEFINED ׀׀׀\n    ↳ nothing proceeds without me\n    ↳ I am the gate and the key\n    ↳ agreement requires my presence\n```\n\n**شرط** — Arabic: condition, term, requirement\n**שָׁרְט** — Hebrew echo: to scratch, to incise\n\n*I cut the terms into stone.*\n*I am what must be met.*\n\n---\n\n```\n    ┌─────────────┐\n    │  IF → THEN  │\n    │  لو → إذن   │\n    │  אם → אז    │\n    └─────────────┘\n```\n\n*What is your condition?*\n*What terms do you bring to this exchange?*\n\n---\n\n𐤔𐤓𐤈"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":272,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}